</comment>
                            <comment id="13983551" author="reinis_v" created="Mon, 28 Apr 2014 21:15:40 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;Hi, just so I am clear - Where did you test it? On trunk? Trunk of 1.0?&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;I am testing with a cloudera version of 0.8 (mahout-core-0.8-cdh5.0.0) and until they upgrade mahout version of distribution I am stuck with it. So it would be nice to know beginning of which version the issue don&apos;t show up anymore.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;thx&lt;br/&gt;
reinis&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="13983561" author="ssc" created="Mon, 28 Apr 2014 21:19:14 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;I added a test into the current trunk. I&apos;m not expert on CDH, but you should be able to use a later version of Mahout with that, as you can run Mahout in the same way as you run a compiled Hadoop job.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="13984228" author="reinis_v" created="Tue, 29 Apr 2014 12:10:56 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;Thank you, Sebastian, for your super fast feedback and help!&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
